ack on Kuala Selangor (1784)","from":1784,"to":1785,"outcome":"The Dutch defeated Sultan Ibrahim at Kuala Selangor in 1784 and forced him out of Kota Malawati; he retook the fort in under a year with help from Pahang.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sultan_of_Selangor"}],"certainty":[{"from":1743,"to":1876,"level":"soft","note":"No treaty or survey lines are given by the pages opened: the realm is a set of river-valley principalities (Bernam, Kuala Selangor, Klang, Langat, Lukut) with approximate frontiers, and the Pangkor-era treaties fix none of them."}],"sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sultan_of_Selangor","title":"Selangor Sultanate (Sultan of Selangor)"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Selangor_Civil_War","title":"Selangor Civil War"}]}